RUF078 [*] `import` inside a function can be a `lazy` import
 --> RUF078.py:5:5
  |
4 | def needs_pandas():
5 |     import pandas  # RUF078
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
6 |
7 |     return pandas.DataFrame()
  |
help: Add the `lazy` keyword
  |
4 | def needs_pandas():
  -     import pandas  # RUF078
5 +     lazy import pandas  # RUF078
6 |
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

